{"name":"Demo: missed call text-back (fictional data)","nodes":[{"id":"0d6e1d38-1158-4f3c-985f-0ffde7d2d2ac","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-608,-456],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":1100,"content":"## Demo: missed call text-back (fictional data)\n\n**Demonstration workflow, fictional data.** Built to show how these are put together. It is not a client system, and no client data appears in it.\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow receives a missed-call webhook, normalizes the caller information, and validates that the phone number is usable. Valid calls are acknowledged, checked against a contact table, routed through after-hours dispatcher approval when needed, then sent an appropriate SMS text-back for known or first-time callers. It logs successful sends, failures, rejected events, and cases where a dispatcher did not approve the text, while notifying dispatchers by email when attention is needed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the webhook URL with the phone system or call-tracking provider that emits missed-call events.\n- Update the Prepare Settings Data node with the business name, Twilio/SMS sender number, scheduling URL, and dispatcher email address.\n- Connect Twilio credentials for the SMS sending node and verify the sender number is approved for outbound messages.\n- Configure email credentials for dispatcher approval, sent notifications, failure alerts, and malformed-event alerts.\n- Create two n8n data tables: `demo_contacts` (phone, name) for the contact lookup, and `demo_missed_calls` (phone, caller_type, status, detail, called_at) for logging rejected, skipped, sent, and failed text events.\n- Review the IF conditions for phone-number validation, business-hours detection, known-customer matching, and dispatcher approval behavior.\n\n### Testing\n\nSend a `POST` with `{ \"from\": \"(555) 555-0101\" }`. To try the in-hours or after-hours path at any time of day, add `\"simulate_after_hours\": false` or `true` to the body.\n\n### Customization\n\nCustomize the known-customer and first-time-caller message templates, business-hours rules, dispatcher approval criteria, and notification recipients to match the real business process."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"77ae99eb-f1bb-496e-be49-b8560ae15a14","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-48,176],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":864,"height":304,"content":"## Receive and validate call\n\nCaptures the missed-call webhook, applies workflow settings, normalizes incoming call fields, and checks whether the caller number is valid before branching."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"8ec701ed-f792-4fc9-8423-17ce897a8a83","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[864,48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":320,"content":"## Acknowledge and check contact\n\nHandles the valid-event path by responding to the webhook, looking up the caller in the contact table, and deciding whether the call is outside business hours."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"386bdb33-0196-4add-821c-f5a9a583ecad","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[864,400],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":320,"content":"## Handle malformed event\n\nHandles invalid phone-number events by returning a rejection response, logging the rejected event, and emailing the dispatcher about the bad payload."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"805ebf5e-8c9d-44ac-b011-71e210227391","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1536,-256],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":624,"height":464,"content":"## After-hours approval gate\n\nRequests dispatcher approval for after-hours text-backs, evaluates whether approval was granted, and logs cases where no message should be sent."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"e77ffdae-1191-4118-aa72-b6ba091cff62","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2192,-16],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":640,"height":496,"content":"## Prepare and send message\n\nClassifies the caller as known or first-time, builds the appropriate SMS message, and sends the text-back through Twilio."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"060475cc-1373-4e84-a0c6-7729c4953567","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2864,-48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Log successful text\n\nRecords successful SMS sends and notifies the dispatcher that the text-back was delivered or accepted for sending."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"25546b29-8a26-4fd1-92a7-78a577af99d7","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2864,304],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":320,"content":"## Handle text failure\n\nRecords failed SMS attempts and alerts the dispatcher to manually call the missed caller back."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"28534c4a-e3e7-4fd4-9e89-139d9a9ab976","name":"When Call Missed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[0,304],"parameters":{"path":"demo-missed-call","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST","responseMode":"responseNode"},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"283d45b3-61a7-4749-bd14-1d4d35328d22","name":"Prepare Settings Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[224,304],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"cfg-business","name":"business_name","type":"string","value":"Northside Heating & Air"},{"id":"cfg-sms-from","name":"sms_from","type":"string","value":"+1234567890"},{"id":"cfg-book","name":"schedule_url","type":"string","value":"https://example.com/schedule"},{"id":"cfg-dispatch","name":"dispatcher_email","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"},{"id":"cfg-sender","name":"sender_email","type":"string","value":"user@example.com"},{"id":"cfg-tz","name":"timezone","type":"string","value":"America/Chicago"},{"id":"cfg-open","name":"open_hour","type":"number","value":7},{"id":"cfg-close","name":"close_hour","type":"number","value":19}]},"includeOtherFields":true},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"0e42ca6f-95d3-433d-9f07-46716e5e99c6","name":"Normalize Call Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[448,304],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"n-phone","name":"phone","type":"string","value":"={{ (() => { const d = String($json.body?.from ?? $json.from ?? \"\").replace(/\\D/g, \"\"); if (d.length === 10) return \"+1\" + d; if (d.length === 11 && d.startsWith(\"1\")) return \"+\" + d; return \"\"; })() }}"},{"id":"n-raw","name":"raw_from","type":"string","value":"={{ String($json.body?.from ?? $json.from ?? \"\") }}"},{"id":"n-at","name":"called_at","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.body?.called_at ?? $now.toISO() }}"},{"id":"n-after","name":"after_hours","type":"boolean","value":"={{ (() => { const f = $json.body?.simulate_after_hours; if (typeof f === \"boolean\") return f; const h = $now.setZone($json.timezone).hour; return h < $json.open_hour || h >= $json.close_hour; })() }}"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"0bad49dc-bca5-4a1b-b892-fc723aeef93e","name":"Check Valid Number","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[672,304],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.phone }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"162a2fcb-0438-439e-9726-8a0392afe01b","name":"Acknowledge Valid Call","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[912,208],"parameters":{"options":{"responseCode":202},"respondWith":"json","responseBody":"={{ { \"status\": \"accepted\", \"phone\": $json.phone } }}"},"typeVersion":1.5},{"id":"5658743d-9571-4878-afb8-042b36a857fa","name":"Search Contact Database","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","onError":"continueRegularOutput","position":[1136,208],"parameters":{"limit":1,"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"phone","keyValue":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.phone }}"}]},"matchType":"allConditions","operation":"get","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"demo_contacts"}},"typeVersion":1.1,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"cd5efb46-871e-4b81-85a5-8836ccbc8f2a","name":"Check After Hours","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1360,208],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.after_hours }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"6c5a6c77-ecac-447b-8c9e-95df389e98ca","name":"Email Dispatcher for Approval","type":"n8n-nodes-base.emailSend","position":[1584,48],"parameters":{"message":"=A call from {{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.phone }} ({{ $('Search Contact Database').item.json.name || 'first-time caller' }}) was missed outside business hours at {{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.called_at }}.\n\nThe text-back is on hold so nobody is texted in the middle of the night. Approve to send it now, or decline to handle the call yourself.","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"=Held: after-hours missed call from {{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.phone }}","toEmail":"={{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.dispatcher_email }}","fromEmail":"={{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.sender_email }}","operation":"sendAndWait","approvalOptions":{"values":{"approvalType":"double","approveLabel":"Send the text now","disapproveLabel":"Do not send"}}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"8824302a-51f8-4048-a1bb-850413f4dce0","name":"Check Dispatcher Approval","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1792,48],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.data.approved }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"f7ec6a2a-a371-40c1-8c2f-5992ab7d714f","name":"Identify Known Customer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[2240,208],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"09f09af4-ca0f-4496-9141-6ebeec56dffe","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $('Search Contact Database').item.json.name ?? '' }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"aee5425c-5ffd-4186-b23f-005d1b558949","name":"Record Unsent Messages","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[2016,-96],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"phone":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.phone }}","detail":"After hours. The dispatcher declined the text and is handling the call.","status":"not_sent","called_at":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.called_at }}","caller_type":"={{ $('Search Contact Database').item.json.name ? 'known' : 'first_time' }}"},"schema":[{"id":"phone","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"phone","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"caller_type","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"caller_type","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"detail","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"detail","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"called_at","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"called_at","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow"},"options":{},"dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"demo_missed_calls"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"a00fdc28-685f-47cd-a71a-19afe8f08726","name":"Prepare Message for Known Caller","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[2464,112],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"k-type","name":"caller_type","type":"string","value":"known"},{"id":"k-msg","name":"message","type":"string","value":"=Hi {{ $('Search Contact Database').item.json.name.split(' ')[0] }}, this is {{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.business_name }}. Sorry we missed your call. Pick a time that suits you here: {{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.schedule_url }} or reply to this text and we will call you back."}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"d7316750-79f5-4175-b304-22971128e3be","name":"Send SMS Response","type":"n8n-nodes-base.twilio","onError":"continueErrorOutput","maxTries":2,"position":[2688,208],"parameters":{"to":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data').item.json.phone }}","from":"={{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.sms_from }}","message":"={{ $json.message }}","options":{}},"retryOnFail":true,"typeVersion":1,"waitBetweenTries":5000},{"id":"88059f5d-a613-4ddc-8d2d-b4c523097e2c","name":"Prepare Message for New Caller","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[2464,304],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"f-type","name":"caller_type","type":"string","value":"first_time"},{"id":"f-msg","name":"message","type":"string","value":"=Hi, this is {{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.business_name }}. Sorry we missed your call. Tell us what you need and pick a time here: {{ $('Prepare Settings Data').item.json.schedule_url }} or reply to this text and we will call you back."}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"324de559-11fb-4758-838f-9650715d4af0","name":"Reject Invalid Call","type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","position":[912,560],"parameters":{"options":{"responseCode":400},"respondWith":"json","responseBody":"={{ { \"error\": \"validation_error\", \"message\": \"Field \\\"from\\\" must be a 10-digit US phone number.\", \"received\": $json.raw_from } }}"},"typeVersion":1.5},{"id":"359535a6-0030-40a1-bb88-27c6d88f9fdb","name":"Record Rejected Calls","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[1136,560],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"phone":"={{ $('Normalize Call Data